// Single MAX7219 8 x 8 LED dot matrix module (FC-16 / common through-hole kit board).
// Seated frame: z = 0 is the 1x5 header plastic's underside, so the board's underside is at
// z = 2.54 mm and its top at z = 4.14 mm. The 32 x 32 mm 8 x 8 matrix sits centred on the
// 50 x 32 mm board with 5-pin IN (VCC, GND, DIN, CS, CLK) at +X and OUT (VCC, GND, DOUT, CS,
// CLK) at -X, both on a 2.54 mm grid.
